          "title": "Logarifmlar",
          "order_num": 1,
          "content": "Logarifm — bu daraja topish amali teskarisi. Agar a^x = b bo'lsa, x = log_a(b) deyiladi. Bu yerda a — asos (a > 0, a ≠ 1), b — argument (b > 0).\n\nLogarifmning asosiy xossalari:\n1. log_a(1) = 0, chunki a^0 = 1\n2. log_a(a) = 1, chunki a^1 = a\n3. log_a(b·c) = log_a(b) + log_a(c) — ko'paytmaning logarifmi\n4. log_a(b/c) = log_a(b) - log_a(c) — bo'linmaning logarifmi\n5. log_a(b^n) = n·log_a(b) — darajaning logarifmi\n6. log_a(b) = log_c(b) / log_c(a) — asosni almashtirish formulasi\n7. log_a(b) = 1 / log_b(a) — teskari logarifm\n\nNatural logarifm ln(x) = log_e(x) bo'lib, e ≈ 2.718.\nO'nlik logarifm lg(x) = log_10(x).\n\nLogarifmik tenglamalar va tengsizliklarni yechishda asosiy usullar:\n- Bir xil asosga keltirish\n- O'rniga qo'yish usuli\n- Logarifmning ta'rifi orqali yechish",
