          "title": "Trigonometriya",
          "order_num": 2,
          "content": "Trigonometriya — burchaklar va ularning funksiyalarini o'rganuvchi matematika bo'limi.\n\nAsosiy trigonometrik funksiyalar:\n- sin(α) — sinus, qarshi katet / gipotenusa\n- cos(α) — kosinus, yondosh katet / gipotenusa\n- tg(α) — tangens, sin(α)/cos(α)\n- ctg(α) — kotangens, cos(α)/sin(α)\n\nAsosiy trigonometrik ayniyatlar:\n1. sin²(α) + cos²(α) = 1\n2. tg(α) = sin(α)/cos(α)\n3. ctg(α) = cos(α)/sin(α)\n4. 1 + tg²(α) = 1/cos²(α)\n5. 1 + ctg²(α) = 1/sin²(α)\n\nQo'shish formulalari:\n- sin(α ± β) = sin(α)·cos(β) ± cos(α)·sin(β)\n- cos(α ± β) = cos(α)·cos(β) ∓ sin(α)·sin(β)\n\nIkkilangan burchak formulalari:\n- sin(2α) = 2·sin(α)·cos(α)\n- cos(2α) = cos²(α) - sin²(α) = 2cos²(α) - 1 = 1 - 2sin²(α)\n\nKeltirish formulalari yordamida istalgan burchakni birinchi chorakdagi burchakka keltirish mumkin.\n\nTrigonometrik tenglamalar:\n- sin(x) = a → x = (-1)^n · arcsin(a) + πn\n- cos(x) = a → x = ± arccos(a) + 2πn\n- tg(x) = a → x = arctg(a) + πn",
